            "review_title": "Review at Hilton Hanoi Opera's Lobby Lounge",
            "review_text": "Passport829999\n20 contributions\n1\nHilton Disgrace\nOct 2019\n4.5 star I think not,\nUpon entering the room you are hit with a bad smell and an appalling dated room the furniture is tired and used,the walls are dirty,peeling and stained.\nThe shower has mould through the silicon \nI’m well aware the hotel is 20 years old but this is routine maintenance for guests paying for 4.5 star. I am severely disappointed that this is the hotel we will be ending our 2.5 weeks in Vietnam if I had the option to receive a refund we would be in a taxi in a heart beat.\nI will just add we are paying for two inter connecting rooms and the quality is the Same in both rooms.\nPlease do yourself a favour and book elsewhere!!\nI’ve stayed in 3 star that has been better then here!!\nRead more\nWritten October 6, 2019",
